Math color (T1.5)
═════════════════

Inline known color: E=mc² stays inline.

All eight base names: g, b, c, m, y, k, w.

Unknown color name renders uncolored: x+1.

Nested inside a fraction the color survives: (a+b)/2.

Inside a script the color flattens away (scripts are leaves): x².

Display math:

    ∑ᵢ₌₁ⁿi=(n(n+1))/2
